    <string name="remote_onboarding_setup">Set up your computer</string>
    <string name="remote_onboarding_setup_body">PocketPi works with pi on your computer through pi Remote. Your computer needs pi with the remote extension, and it has to stay awake and online while you use the app.</string>
    <string name="remote_onboarding_setup_projects">Only projects you share on the computer appear here. You can remove a pairing at any time, here or on the computer.</string>
